            "notes": "Round 1 we start with  [Hidden Blade](item_a820416d-85e5-4018-b20a-dc1cbf744900) to increase survivability as well as our melee damage. Survivability is important for round 1 as it allows you to collect as much cash as possible. You can't collect ash if you're not alive obviously.\n\nWe also go  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) to boost damage and survivability. As well as  [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) for the same reason.\n\nThis initial loadout is credited to b3n_fps on YouTube. It is a very strong round 1 loadout that focuses on survivability and melee damage, which makes opportunistic elims easier. \n\nQuote from the video: \"The ideas here is stacking melee damage and lifesteal early so you can take almost any 1v1 in the game. Believe it or not, even Moira becomes a cake walk with these items because you can easily out-heal her damage. Play around taking these isolated 1v1s and spam right-click melee.\"",
