            "created_at": "2025-07-31T17:31:26.378736+00:00",
            "notes": "This round we sell  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) in favor of  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), which is just a very useful ability with the damage and lifesteal boosts. Now it isn't just your regular attacks and melee that grant lifesteal, your dash does too as well as dealing more damage.\n\nWe hold onto  [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) for the time being to keep our survivability up.\n\nQuote from the video: \"With any remaining money just stack weapon and ability power, which will become a recurring theme. If you can't get  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) just pick up your core greens weapon and ability power and lifesteal.\"",
