            "notes": "Round 3 is when this build really starts coming online with our next power  [Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba). This power will be the core of the build from here on out.\n\nThis round, we will sell every item and purchase the follow epics in this order:\n1.  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb)\n2.  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)\n3.  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429)\nThis order was chosen through Karkat's own testing and is based on how muc heach item increases your damage.\n\nIf you are unable to purchase all three, buy items that boost weapon power and then ability power.\n\nQuote from the video: \"You're building towards the strongest Genji one-shot combo physically possible. Every time you use an ability you're gonna get a straight damage buff to your next attack AND your right-click will have two extra shurikens that home in.\"",
